--TEST--
a parameter is refused, because a call can pass it by name and renaming it would break that call, `rule:ide/no-refactoring-introduces-an-alias`
--FILE--
<?nvs
class Greeter
{
    public function greet(string $name): string
    {
        return "Hello, " . $na<|>me;
    }
}

echo new Greeter()->greet(name: "Ada");
--REQUEST--
rename to=person
--EXPECT--
refused: `$name` is a parameter, and a call can pass it by name. Renaming a parameter is not available.
